  "description": "It is proposed to construct a new GRP plant housing adjoining the existing generator enclosure and HV sub-station. The purpose of this building is to house new switchgear as part of the site wide electrical infrastructure. The existing switchgear has reached the end of its service life and the supply cables to it are being replaced. \n\nThe GRP housing will be site on a concrete plinth, with cables entering the housing to the rear above ground due to the presence of other services in the area. \n\nThe existing switchgear panel is located within the generator housing. The space in which it is being installed is below current standards. In addition to replace the switchgear in its current location would require the power to be isolated for up to a week, which is unacceptable for the provision of healthcare services on the site. ",
